OL,3,GNEWSATraffic wardens travel on buses to
OL,4,Atackle delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraffic wardens are set to travel on
OL,7,Fbuses in a bid to improve bus
OL,8,Freliability and tackle delays.
OL,10,FCivil enforcement officers will ride on
OL,11,Fbuses across Plymouth to identify
OL,12,Fvehicles illegally parked in bus stops,
OL,13,Fbus lanes and other locations which
OL,14,Fcould disrupt journeys, bosses said.
OL,16,FThe project, funded through the
OL,17,FDepartment for Transport's bus service
OL,18,Fimprovement plan, forms part of
OL,19,FPlymouth's enhanced bus partnership
OL,20,Fprogramme - to deliver faster, more
OL,21,Freliable and more accessible bus
OL,22,Fservices across the city.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
